---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';

const lastUpdated = 'September 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Luma Pediatrics"
  path="/terms"
  description="Terms and conditions for SMS customer care communications from Luma Pediatrics in McKinney, TX."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', path: '/' },
    { name: 'Terms & Conditions', path: '/terms' },
  ]}
>
  <section class="page-hero py-14 md:py-20 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center fade-up">
      <span class="eyebrow">Terms &amp; Conditions</span>
      <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight">Luma Pediatrics SMS Terms</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--color-muted-foreground)]">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-20 md:pb-28 reveal">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 prose-luma">
      <h2>Website Terms &amp; Conditions</h2>
      <p>
        These Terms &amp; Conditions govern your use of the Luma Pediatrics website and its public
        communication channels. By using the website, you agree to these terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Future practice status</h2>
      <p>
        Luma Pediatrics is a future independent pediatric practice in McKinney, Texas.
        <strong>{SITE.status}.</strong> The practice is not currently open, accepting patients, or scheduling
        appointments. Descriptions of services, hours, and availability are plans and may change
        before opening.
      </p>

      <h2>General information only</h2>
      <p>
        Website content is provided for general educational and business information. It is not
        medical advice and is not a substitute for care from a qualified healthcare provider. Do not
        use this website, email, or text messaging for diagnosis, treatment, urgent concerns, or
        emergency care. Contact your current healthcare provider for medical concerns. For a medical
        emergency, call 911.
      </p>

      <h2>No physician-patient relationship</h2>
      <p>
        Visiting this website, joining the email updates list, or contacting Luma Pediatrics by
        phone, text, or email does not establish a physician-patient relationship. A relationship can
        be established only after the practice opens and appropriate registration and care occur.
      </p>

      <h2>Email updates</h2>
      <p>
        Individuals may voluntarily subscribe to occasional email updates about the planned opening
        and general services. Email updates are not patient registration or appointment requests.
        Subscribers may unsubscribe at any time.
      </p>

      <h2>Luma Pediatrics SMS Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By opting in to receive SMS messages from <strong>Luma Pediatrics</strong>, you agree to
        receive <strong>customer care messages</strong>.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Message frequency:</strong><br />
        Message frequency may vary. On average, 1-2 messages per month.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>Privacy Policy:</strong><br />
        Please review our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>{'.'}
      </p>

      <p>
        By using our services, you acknowledge and agree to these terms and confirm that you can
        easily access our Privacy Policy using the link above.
      </p>

      <p><strong>Opt-out:</strong> You can opt out of SMS messages at any time by replying STOP.</p>

      <p><strong>Help:</strong> Reply HELP for assistance.</p>

      <p>Message and data rates may apply depending on your mobile carrier and plan.</p>

      <p>
        SMS communications are not intended for medical advice, diagnosis, treatment, or emergency
        care. For a medical emergency, call 911.
      </p>

      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>
        You agree not to misuse the website, interfere with its operation, attempt unauthorized
        access, submit unlawful or harmful content, or use automated means that place an unreasonable
        burden on the site.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        Website content, branding, graphics, and original materials are owned by or licensed to Luma
        Pediatrics and may not be reproduced or used commercially without permission, except as
        allowed by law.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party content and links</h2>
      <p>
        Links to third-party resources are provided for convenience. Luma Pediatrics does not control
        and is not responsible for third-party content, availability, security, or privacy practices.
      </p>

      <h2>No warranties</h2>
      <p>
        The website is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. To the extent permitted by
        law, Luma Pediatrics does not warrant that the site will always be available, error-free, or
        complete. Medical and public-health information can change, so confirm health decisions with
        your current healthcare provider.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the extent permitted by law, Luma Pediatrics is not liable for indirect, incidental,
        special, or consequential damages arising from use of or reliance on this website or linked
        third-party resources.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms from time to time. The "Last updated" date above identifies the
        current version. Continued use of the website after an update constitutes acceptance of the
        revised terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Texas, without regard to conflict-of-law
        principles. Any applicable rights that cannot legally be limited remain unaffected.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms may be sent to
        {' '}<a href={SITE.contact.emailHref}>{SITE.contact.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose-luma h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }
  .prose-luma p {
    color: rgba(11, 29, 58, 0.85);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
  .prose-luma ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
  .prose-luma li {
    color: rgba(11, 29, 58, 0.85);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .prose-luma a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
